    step 0
    date "2020-07-19T05:48:41Z"
    title "Quarantine Conspiracy Theory: QAnon"
    description "At a time where misinformation spreads like wildfire, a restless public under COVID-19 quarantine has started to spread all sorts of conspiracy theories about COVID, bringing them out of the margins and into the mainstream. Lee Adams, self-isolated in his home, is getting to the bottom of the wildest theories on the web. &#10;&#10;In this episode of The Rabbit Hole, we investigate the conspiracy theory group, QAnon. QAnon is a fringe community of Trump supporters who started in 2017. The group  Followers of Q are using the internet to spread their possibly unfounded theories on COVID- 19. We speak to Qanon believers, virologists and conspiracy theory experts to see if there&#8217;s truth to these COVID conspiracy theories&#8230; follow us down the rabbit hole.&#10;&#10;Click here to SUBSCRIBE to VICE Asia: https://bit.ly/2LhqAR9&#10;&#10;Connect with VICE Asia: &#10;Check out our full video catalog: https://bit.ly/2P3Y0pv&#10;Videos, daily editorial and more: http://vice.com/en_asia&#10;More videos from the VICE network: https://fb.com/viceasia/videos/&#10;Like VICE Asia on Facebook: http://fb.com/viceasia&#10;Follow VICE Asia on Twitter: https://twitter.com/viceasia&#10;Follow us on Instagram: https://www.instagram.com/viceasia/"
