.com/DavidGoldbergNY/status/792766614827470848&#10;&#8220;A New Wave Of &#8216;QAnon&#8217; Activists Emerge From The Cult Of MAGA&#8221;: https://www.rightwingwatch.org/post/a-new-wave-of-qanon-activists-emerge-from-the-cult-of-maga/&#10;&#8220;Who are QAnon Supporters? 5 Revealing Findings from Survey Data&#8221;: https://morningsidepost.com/articles/2021/3/8/who-are-qanon-supporters-5-revealing-findings-from-survey-data &#10;Full transcriptions of Qanon drops&#8211;&#8211;WIP: https://krypt3ia.files.wordpress.com/2018/08/q_s_posts_-_cbts_-_7-2-0.pdf&#10;&#8220;Why hundreds of QAnon supporters showed up in Dallas, expecting JFK Jr.&#8217;s return&#8221;: https://www.washingtonpost.com/nation/2021/11/02/qanon-jfk-jr-dallas/&#10;&#8220;Fox News Hosts Conveniently Ignore the News of Their Private January 6th Fears &#8221;: https://www.vanityfair.com/news/2021/12/fox-news-hosts-january-6-fears&#10;CONSPIRACY ESSAYS:&#10;&#8220;Kubrick and the Paranoid Style: Antisemitism, Conspiracy Theories, and The Shining&#8221;: https://www.sensesofcinema.com/2020/the-shining-at-40/kubrick-paranoid-style-antisemitism-conspiracy-theories/&#10;&#8220;Hitler's Racial Ideology: Content and Occult Sources&#8221;: https://www.museumoftolerance.com/education/archives-and-reference-library/online-resources/simon-wiesenthal-center-annual-volume-3/annual-3-chapter-9.html&#10;&#8220;The Paranoid Style in American Politics&#8221;, Richard Hofstadter: http://users.clas.ufl.edu/burt/spaceshotsairheads/HofstaderparanoidstyleHarpers.pdf &#10;A Bioweapon or a Hoax? The Link Between Distinct Conspiracy Beliefs About the Coronavirus Disease (COVID-19) Outbreak and Pandemic Behavior:&#10;https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pmc/articles/PMC7342934/ &#10;OUTSIDE READING:&#10;&#8220;The Secret Doctrine by H. P. Blavatsky -- Vol. 2&#8221;: https://www.sacred-texts.com/the/sd/sd2-1-21.htm &#10;IF YOU HATE READING:&#10;HBO Documentary - &#8220;Q: Into the Storm&#8221;&#10;VICE - How 8chan Became The Worst Place on The Internet: &#10;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Kerg2rrIdAU &#10;VICE - QAnon Conspiracies Are Tearing Through Evangelical America: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=rYMIozCKxGE &#10;David Dees Documentary - &#8220;Do you see what I see?&#8221;: https://vimeo.com/577756310&#10;David Dees Art Masterpost: https://www.reddit.com/r/DataHoarder/comments/gxp1ti/requesting_the_archival_of_ddeescom_before_it/ &#10;&#10;if you scrolled all the way down here, uh... woof!"
