    date "2020-11-23T10:09:11Z"
    title "Attorney and QAnon supporter Sidney Powell speaks at Rudy Giuliani briefing"
    description "Attorney and QAnon supporter Sidney Powell speaks at a Rudy Giuliani press conference in Philadelphia, in which she made an unfounded claim that Democrats had 'paid' to rig the election in Biden's favor. The Donald Trump legal team has now denied she is now working with them. In a written statement issued by Trump's personal attorney Rudy Giuliani, and his senior campaign adviser, Jenna Ellis on Sunday, they said: 'Sidney Powell is practicing law on her own.' 'She is not a member of the Trump Legal Team,' the message continued. 'She is also not a lawyer for the President in his personal capacity.' &#10;&#10;Original Article: http://www.dailymail.co.uk/news/article-8975945/Trump-campaign-says-attorney-QAnon-supporter-Sidney-Powell-NOT-legal-team.html&#10;Original Video: http://www.dailymail.co.uk/video/news/video-2298214/Video-Attorney-QAnon-supporter-Powell-speaks-Giuliani-briefing.html&#10;&#10;Daily Mail Facebook: http://facebook.com/dailymail&#10;Daily Mail IG: http://instagram.com/dailymail&#10;Daily Mail Snap: https://www.snapchat.com/discover/Daily-Mail/8392137033&#10;Daily Mail Twitter: http://twitter.com/MailOnline&#10;Daily Mail Pinterest: http://pinterest.co.uk/dailymail&#10;Daily Mail Google+: https://plus.google.com/+DailyMail&#10;&#10;Get the free Daily Mail mobile app: http://dailymail.co.uk/mobile"
