  node [
    id 293
    label "jAKw_NCFEgM"
    step 0
    date "2021-01-27T18:38:59Z"
    title "Whats Q got to do with it? (Tina Turner QAnon song parody)"
    description "What is QAnon? What&#8217;s Q got to do with it? May the almighty powers of truth, logic, and Philip Sparkle dressed as ass-clown QAnon shaman Jake Angeli parodying Tina Turner destroy Q once and for all. &#10;&#10;QAnon followers - hopefully by now you realize you&#8217;ve been lied to and have retreated back to the bowels of the internet. Or have picked up some new hobbies that don&#8217;t include hate-filled, irrational conspiracy theories and violent insurrection aimed at murdering our members of Congress and tearing down our democracy. If not, this parody is for you and all your friends - the Neo Nazis, white supremacists, unhinged militia groups, Incels using third-rate moisturizers, and anyone else brain washed by the overweight, power hungry, lying geriatric that is Donald Trump. &#10;&#10;What is QAnon? QAnon is a cult. It is the largest, most successful brainwashing in this country&#8217;s history. Made possible by social media outlets that let violent, irresponsibly misinformed people assemble for years in plain sight. They believe a secret cabal of Satan-worshipping, cannibalistic pedophiles is running a global sex trafficking ring in a plot against Donald Trump. Cannibalism? Seriously? Who has time for that? Cooking everyday is enough work without having to hunt down victims and elaborately throw law enforcement off the scent of your scheme. Hillary Clinton is most certainly just ordering in. As crazy as all this sounds, they&#8217;re actually using recycled old anti-Semitic tropes as the base for their conspiracies. Not even clever enough to come up with with their own.&#10;&#10;Enjoy Philip acting out the mental unraveling of Jake Angeli, the QAnon shaman. We&#8217;re guessing the term &#8220;QAnon shaman&#8221; is self-appointed. One would think a following whose shaman is a 33-year old failed actor still living with his mother in Arizona should have given the Q followers pause - or at least look up his credits on IMDB first. &#10;&#10;QAnon has even infiltrated our government through the likes of Marjorie Taylor Greene. Who is Marjorie Taylor Greene you ask? She&#8217;s a Georgia Representative in Congress and QAnon believer who is known for physically and verbally accosting teenage Parkland school shooting survivor, David Hogg&#8212;calling him a coward, endorsing the execution of House Speaker Nancy Pelosi on Facebook and denying the Sandy Hook school shooting where 20 first graders were brutally murdered ever happened - yet doesn't see the value in walking through a metal detector to enter the Capitol building despite her dangerous, violence inciting track record. She&#8217;s just that cuckoo for QAnon. Answering the question who is Marjorie Taylor Greene is frankly too much to unpack and her representation in Congress should scare the living shit out of everyone.  &#10;&#10;Donald Trump&#8217;s years of repeated lies and assassination of our free press allowed QAnon and white domestic terrorist groups to thrive. They are the biggest threat to our democracy and have been dangerously perpetuated by his army of twisted mouthpieces to the likes of Kellyanne Conway, Kevin McCarthy, Mitch McConnell, Ted Cruz, et al. Thanks Kellyanne Conway, for your years of dedicated service answering our questions by changing the subject entirely.&#10;&#10;Even with Donald Trump out of office, we need to hold the lying, morally bankrupt Republican Party accountable. The insurrection at the Capitol was a violent coup attempt and everyone who participated should be prosecuted as if they were international terrorists. Please, Justice Department, don&#8217;t just insult us with these trespassing charges. The terrifying reality is that as QAnon followers become further disenfranchised, they will walk into the arms of Neo-Nazis and white supremacists posing an even greater threat to our safety.&#10;&#10;What is QAnon? More importantly, what&#8217;s Q got to do with it - our democracy, our country, the soul of our nation? This parody attempts at answering that, but more importantly offers some much-needed ridicule so we can all feel a little better and look to a brighter future.&#10;&#10;The Demon Rats&#10;Performer: Philip Sparkle | https://philipsparkle.com/&#10;Lyrics: Julie Rega | http://julierega.com/&#10;Video: Sam Baumel | http://sambaumel.com&#10;&#10;Music Production: Sweet Tea Studios BK | https://facebook.com/sweetteastudiobk&#10;Special Thanks: Hester Wilkinson&#10;&#10;Parody of Tina Turner&#8217;s &#8220;What&#8217;s Love Got to Do with It&#8221; &#10;Original song written by Terry Britten and Graham Lyle&#10;&#10;&#8212;&#8212;&#10;Disclaimer: The Demon Rats would like our viewers to know that we in no way aim to make light of the abhorrent riot that took place at the Capitol on January 6, 2021. All actions and images shown in this video are a satire of the desecration of our flag and country made by these insurrectionists. We choose to use parody, joy, and humor as an act of resistance and are forever grateful to those who risked and lost their lives defending our democracy and members of Congress."
    channeltitle "Philip Sparkle"
