    label "4p5HZkZV1gQ"
    step 0
    date "2018-08-04T21:37:52Z"
    title "Is Q (#QAnon) the Red Pill ?"
    description "Is Q (#QAnon) the Red Pill ?&#10;&#10;Who or What is Q?  As an alternative source of &#34;What's Really Going On&#34; vis-a-vis the Main Stream Media (MSM) propaganda, does Q represent a path towards #TheGreatAwakening that many Patriots and Truth-Seekers are searching for, believing and following? Can we handle the Truth? Is Q the Red Pill?&#10;&#10;Here are resources to discover and understand the Q phenomena and &#34;What's Really Going On&#34; in our world:&#10;&#10;(1) &#34;Q - The Plan To Save The World REMASTERED&#34; and &#34;Q - Killing the Mockingbird&#34;  and &#34;Q - We Are The Plan&#34; and &#34;Q - Dark To Light&#34; by JoeM &#34;StormisUponUs&#34; &#10;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=KVeDKuHPDK8 and https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=80s5xuvzCtg and https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=MRtEgdgj_XQ and https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=NGuyUyRBsA4 &#10;Perhaps the best, big-picture summary of the &#34;Q message/Plan&#34; and the great danger we face as expressed from the (to-date anonymous) Q-team.These four, short videos, are recommended to be viewed first to grasp the importance and the great urgency of Q for everyone. #WWG1WGA&#10;&#10;(2) &#34;Q For Beginners Part 1 - Who is Q?&#34; by &#34;prayingmedic&#34; https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=5vYqqH3-xFY&#38;feature=youtu.be&#10;This is an excellent and straight-forward, no-nonsense journalist briefly explaining and introducing the Q (or QAnon) phenomenon.&#10;&#10;(3) https://qanon.pub  -  Here please find all of the up-to-date, #QAnon posts. Across the internet, there are many high-quality sources to help understand and decode the content of #QAnon. Two favorites are: prayingmedic (youtube channel: https://www.youtube.com/user/prayingmedic and website:  https://prayingmedic.com/ ) and https://twitter.com/Jordan_Sather_ (Jordan's youtube channel: https://t.co/ki6dS6Qxbx ).&#10;&#10;Music and Graphics Resources:&#10;&#10;(1) &#34;Stars&#34; from Les Miserables by Sean and Scott Holshouser from https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=kLntt0vYrWA&#10;&#10;(2) &#34;Do You Hear the People Sing&#34; from Les Miserables by Treorchy Male Choir from https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_EQr5nzSiTM&#10;&#10;(3) &#34;Les Mis - Do You Hear the People Sing&#34; from Les Miserables by Baldwin-Wallace College Musical Theatre students from https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=UXqkYU676eU&#10;&#10;(4) Q-cards - The beautiful cards were made by an anonymous Artist(s?) to help synthesise while quickly and visually explaining some of the many subjects shared in the over 4000 #Qanon posts to date. &#10;&#10;Please note - This video was created and published unlisted for friends and family in March, 2018 and publicly in August by lgflower. There are 120+ Q-cards - at least 10 more than included here."
